  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.4 - Depends on SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.12: SpawnJSRuntime.AppBaseUri works under Node (a .NET WebAssembly console app); it was empty there. v2.1.3 - Depends on SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.10 (was 3.0.5): WebAuthn JSON converters, trimmed apps about 630 KB smaller (a narrower trim descriptor) and the 3.0.6 - 3.0.8 fixes (see SpawnDev.SpawnJS's CHANGELOG). An app that got SpawnJS only through this package stayed on 3.0.5. No change of its own. v2.1.2 - Depends on SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.5 (was 3.0.0): its JSTape no longer allocates memory quadratic in the size of a big call. No change of its own; the 29-test browser suite passes.",
